<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus tenders for maize and barley.</title>
<headline>Cyprus tenders for maize and barley.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission said it invited tenders for 18,000 tonnes of maize and 25,000 tonnes of barley for shipment in July.</p>
<p>The tenders close Tuesday June 17.</p>
</text>
